{"reviewId": "385467182_8bnNn6iMf", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "也就是说当社会生产效率因为没有新技术出现，效率低，但是为了追求利益最大化，资本会追加投资，于是对人工，对原材料的需求会增大，与此同时新的国家开始工业化，让原材料的价格更高。而在此之前，原材料的价格偏低，需求不大，导致开采也不多，最后导致原材料价格因为需求变多，价格变高。\n而原材料价格高了，但是生产效率上不去，又会影响企业利润。企业就倒闭关门，更多人失业，就进入衰退期。\n是这个意思吗", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4566-4660", "abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "385467182_8bnNn6iMf", "userVid": 385467182, "topics": [], "createTime": 1786810242, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 385467182, "name": "星🔥", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/w74m73icotZZbCmLcnZtLmNxCJz4rl0kdEsiaZibviaAcWKGzseRda2taKicEuyQWiaF2iciaqNer6hC3Wp9Tp2lZibxUuNBDxfpleHAbXPFz9AT3tLw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "以书会友，互相学习", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20251215-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我理解的也是这样", "reviewId": "385467182_8bnNn6iMf", "commentId": "385467182_8bnNn6iMf_c353636138_8cWTIzFS4", "userVid": 353636138, "createTime": 1792325679, "author": {"userVid": 353636138, "name": "此情可待", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Qngiax50Le0LCmyHjcEFALFpNMNIsqsucY8FVz36vfwruB2BTBkcUtica0ia2tMKkYCBq7JzrNQLTKZrdwQCibeJ8w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "is